iew body after the column header was reworded.\n\n### R70 §Steps 6 build / test / bench commands\n\n`cd daemon && cargo build --release`\n```\nwarning: `lattice-daemon` (bin \"lattice\") generated 21 warnings (9 duplicates)\nFinished `release` profile [optimized] target(s) in 3m 10s\n```\nAll 21 warnings are pre-existing dead-code / unused-import warnings in `rpc/identity_payload.rs`, `rpc/mcp.rs`, and `rpc/memory_v2/get_task_memory.rs`; none introduced by Phase 9 code.\n\n`cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib metrics`\n```\nrunning 18 tests\ntest metrics::report_tests::fail_on_regression_exit_code_is_non_zero_only_when_requested ... ok\ntest metrics::report_tests::null_signals_render_as_na_with_reason_never_zero ... ok\ntest metrics::report_tests::report_computes_baseline_delta_and_reduction ... ok\ntest metrics::report_tests::benchmark_evidence_round_trips_to_signal_rows ... ok\ntest metrics::report_tests::threshold_logic_covers_each_initial_target ... ok\ntest metrics::signals_tests::collectors_report_honest_nulls_when_scope_has_no_data ... ok\ntest metrics::report_tests::report_renders_deterministically_in_all_formats ... ok\ntest metrics::signals_tests::collectors_return_expected_values_for_handcrafted_fixture ... ok\ntest metrics::signals_tests::every_metric_signal_variant_collects_deterministically ... ok\ntest metrics::signals_tests::sample_size_bounds_mark_metrics_incomplete ... ok\ntest retrieval_v1::benchmark::retrieval_v1_benchmark_writes_metrics_snapshot ... ignored\ntest metrics::signals_tests::scope_filters_prevent_cross_scope_leakage ... ok\ntest metrics::regression_tests::test_zero_trusted_display_of_contradicted_memory ... ok\ntest metrics::regression_tests::test_discovery_tool_calls_at_least_30pct_below_baseline ... ok\ntest metrics::regression_tests::test_zero_trusted_display_of_stale_memory_without_label ... ok\ntest metrics::regression_tests::test_irrelevant_file_reads_at_least_40pct_below_baseline ... ok\ntest metrics::regression_test